      <h1>Can Your Vibe-Coded App <em>Get You Sued?</em></h1>
      <p class="dek">Short videos warn that AI-built apps quietly break privacy and marketing laws, with six-figure penalties attached. Some of those warnings are right, some inflate the numbers, and a few get the law wrong. Here is each claim checked against the actual statutes and rulings, the real 2026 figures, and the exact instructions to give your coding agent.</p>
