        <li>Google Workspace Admin Help, <a href="https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Email sender guidelines</a> (one-click unsubscribe for senders of more than 5,000 messages a day, from February 2024).</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/47/227" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">47 USC 227</a> (TCPA damages) and <a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/47/64.1200" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">47 CFR 64.1200</a> (prior express written consent; opt-outs within 10 business days).</li>
        <li>JD Supra (Shipkevich, citing WebRecon), <a href="https://www.jdsupra.com/legalnews/december-2025-litigation-update-5845819/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">December 2025 litigation update</a> (about 2,810 TCPA lawsuits in 2025).</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/8403" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">15 USC 8403</a>, Restore Online Shoppers' Confidence Act.</li>
        <li>California Business and Professions Code section 17602, <a href="https://california.public.law/codes/ca_bus_and_prof_code_section_17602" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Automatic Renewal Law</a>, as amended by AB 2863, operative 1 July 2025.</li>
      </ol>
